WEBVTT

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.130
On I go, searching for...

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:20.330
The past that was stolen from me

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.420
Wandering on through...

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.130
This city, so strange to see

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:32.000
Choked by the scent of flames that seems to...

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:33.880
Cling to me

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:37.630
Didn't we both say our goodbyes...

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:40.540
And go our separate ways?

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.790
When you see the face of hell...

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.330
It will squeeze your heart dry

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:52.750
Fighting on seems so pointless now

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.540
If this must be my fate...

00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:00.790
Then I'll make my mind up now

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:05.960
So, please, won't you just leave me be...

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.750
Another day

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:15.250
Oh, will tomorrow hold something new to see?

00:01:40.290 --> 00:01:41.130
Again?

00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:48.130
Shako, kill your engine!

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:50.170
Shut down every system!

00:01:53.330 --> 00:01:55.920
Arron, switch off! Stop the engine!

00:01:58.750 --> 00:02:00.080
What's happening?

00:02:00.080 --> 00:02:01.880
What have we set into motion?

00:02:25.210 --> 00:02:30.210
Contact

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:36.040
We don't know who they are.

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:41.210
But they showed up with around
50 ATs to take over Gomor.

00:02:41.710 --> 00:02:42.750
Their objective?

00:02:43.130 --> 00:02:43.920
Unknown.

00:02:43.920 --> 00:02:45.750
What about the AT force?

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:48.000
It's vanished from the city.

00:02:48.170 --> 00:02:49.080
Vanished?

00:02:49.330 --> 00:02:52.210
Yes, sir. We're still gathering data on that.

00:02:52.210 --> 00:02:54.000
Any reports of a man named Chirico?

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:55.500
Yes, sir. We have several in.

00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:57.130
Good! Tell me!

00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:16.000
You can at least let us eat in peace.

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:17.080
Exactly.

00:03:17.080 --> 00:03:19.000
We're not gonna try to run away and hide, man!

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:23.630
Yeah! You guys arrested us illegally!

00:03:23.630 --> 00:03:26.040
C'mon, the Captain will let us go
if we can explain.

00:03:26.380 --> 00:03:28.460
You can when the time comes.

00:03:28.460 --> 00:03:30.000
When's that gonna be?

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:31.460
When the time comes.

00:03:31.460 --> 00:03:32.710
And when is it gonna-

00:03:32.710 --> 00:03:34.580
Quit complainin' and eat!

00:03:35.460 --> 00:03:38.540
Oh, so now you point your gun at
the unarmed civilians? Jerk!

00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:44.210
You know, you should really feel sorry for us.

00:03:44.210 --> 00:03:46.710
First we had bad guys after us on Sunsa,

00:03:46.710 --> 00:03:49.750
and, just as we finally get away, this happens.

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:51.790
Yeah, my heart's just freaking
bleeding for you people.

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:53.830
Now finish your food.

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:55.330
I've got other work to do.

00:03:55.330 --> 00:03:57.460
Why don't you just leave us alone, then?

00:03:57.460 --> 00:03:58.540
Shut up and eat!

00:03:58.540 --> 00:04:00.460
Food doesn't taste as good
when you can't talk!

00:04:00.460 --> 00:04:01.580
Hold on, Coconna...

00:04:02.250 --> 00:04:03.710
Come on, look at it this way.

00:04:03.710 --> 00:04:08.420
If you feel sorry for us, then just
let us see the Captain, please?

00:04:08.580 --> 00:04:10.250
You will when the time comes.

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:12.330
God dammit, is that all you know how to say?

00:04:12.330 --> 00:04:15.330
Commander in Chief Hallory.
Commander in Chief Hallory.

00:04:15.330 --> 00:04:17.380
Please report to the bridge at once.

00:04:20.920 --> 00:04:23.750
Sir, we have an emergency communique
from homeworld.

00:04:23.750 --> 00:04:26.540
Something's happening in Gomor, on Quent.

00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:29.000
Gomor, on Quent?

00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:34.000
An unidentified group has sent
50 ATs to take control of it.

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:38.040
"Balarant fleet making for Quent."

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:41.380
"Rochina to make planetfall with the Prototype..."

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:43.670
Is he that traitor I heard about?

00:04:43.670 --> 00:04:47.670
Yes, sir. He used to be
an Intelligence Officer for us.

00:04:48.380 --> 00:04:52.960
Homeworld says they want you
to proceed to Quent ASAP.

00:04:52.960 --> 00:04:55.710
We have to protect our interests there.

00:04:55.710 --> 00:04:58.540
All right, change course at once!

00:04:58.540 --> 00:04:59.380
Aye, sir!

00:05:01.750 --> 00:05:03.500
You don't have to shove!

00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:05.080
Just pipe down!

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:06.460
Bleagh!

00:05:06.790 --> 00:05:10.460
Damn, now that we've eaten,
there's nothing to do.

00:05:10.460 --> 00:05:11.880
What's going on?

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:19.880
The ships are changing course.

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:23.670
There's probably been a major change of plans.

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:25.080
I wonder where we're going.

00:06:18.710 --> 00:06:22.710
Even if we run into Chirico,
I don't think you'll try to escape with him.

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:25.170
Why would you say that?

00:06:25.750 --> 00:06:29.750
Because I think you know that
just running away solves nothing.

00:06:53.710 --> 00:06:58.420
The lost civilization's ruins hidden beneath Quent
were beyond my imagination.

00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:02.920
Looking at them, the only remains
of Shako's ancestors,

00:07:03.920 --> 00:07:06.420
I wondered about the people
who had built them.

00:07:07.420 --> 00:07:11.630
And also what all of this had to do with me.

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:32.040
What is all this?

00:07:32.830 --> 00:07:34.500
You're about to see.

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:37.040
You seem to know a lot about this world.

00:07:37.040 --> 00:07:42.000
I was stationed here awhile back
to recruit mercenaries.

00:07:53.790 --> 00:07:57.630
Well, we may have gotten away,
but it looks like we underestimated that device.

00:07:57.630 --> 00:08:00.880
Right. We shouldn't fool with it carelessly.

00:08:00.880 --> 00:08:05.000
Exactly. Looks like we'll have to
rethink our plan of attack.

00:08:38.500 --> 00:08:39.580
This way.

00:08:53.040 --> 00:08:54.580
Where are we?

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:56.420
What is all this?

00:08:56.750 --> 00:08:59.460
We're inside the remains of
Quent's ancient civilization.

00:08:59.460 --> 00:09:03.460
Surrounded by examples of its super-science.

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:45.830
Maybe it's telling us to go this way?

00:11:23.380 --> 00:11:24.880
Do you remember?

00:11:24.880 --> 00:11:28.460
I said you'd meet my master someday.

00:11:28.880 --> 00:11:32.380
You said Chirico would find something here.

00:11:32.380 --> 00:11:34.830
Exactly. He'll find it.

00:11:34.830 --> 00:11:37.580
Or perhaps he's found it already.

00:12:08.080 --> 00:12:10.670
At that moment, even more than the shocks,

00:12:10.670 --> 00:12:12.920
I felt the power of a strange,
enormous intelligence.

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:16.420
But, rather than wanting me to submit to it,

00:12:16.420 --> 00:12:19.420
I sensed it wanted to tell me something.

00:12:26.080 --> 00:12:29.420
It was the glorious civilization of ancient Quent.

00:12:30.330 --> 00:12:35.380
Images of things I'd never seen before
appeared and vanished in my mind like dreams.

00:12:37.040 --> 00:12:39.960
It was telling me the history of Quent.

00:12:51.460 --> 00:12:57.080
My master is a mysterious intelligence
born of 85,000 years of Quentian civilization.

00:12:57.460 --> 00:12:58.710
"Mysterious intelligence?"

00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:01.670
Yes. An intelligence that exists here.

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:04.880
One that ordered me to watch over Chirico.

00:13:05.830 --> 00:13:09.330
Ever since he first entered battle
as an Armored Trooper.

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:39.170
3,000 years ago, the Quentian civilization
extended to the limits of the Astragius Galaxy.

00:13:39.170 --> 00:13:41.920
That technology seemed to call out
for a new breed of man...

00:13:41.920 --> 00:13:44.790
and gave rise to the "Overmen".
People with extraordinary abilities.

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:48.830
But, because of those very same
abilities they possessed,

00:13:48.830 --> 00:13:51.250
the Overmen were exiled from Quent.

00:13:51.540 --> 00:13:57.080
They took advantage of their superiority
in their quest to control the galaxy,

00:13:57.080 --> 00:14:00.460
and began manipulating both
the Gilgamesh and the Balarant.

00:14:00.460 --> 00:14:04.580
Though I don't know his true form,
I do know my master is one of them.

00:14:10.460 --> 00:14:12.170
Are you okay, Chirico?

00:14:13.170 --> 00:14:14.330
Yeah...

00:14:16.880 --> 00:14:17.670
Chirico!

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:19.500
Fyana!

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:21.330
Chirico!

00:14:21.670 --> 00:14:22.750
Chirico!

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:25.080
Fyana!

00:14:25.920 --> 00:14:29.250
Chirico... Thank goodness you're safe.

00:14:29.250 --> 00:14:31.630
Forgive our interruption.

00:14:32.210 --> 00:14:33.290
So, Chirico.

00:14:33.290 --> 00:14:38.130
It seems the dramatic meeting is finished
between you and my master.

00:14:38.790 --> 00:14:40.130
Master?

00:14:40.130 --> 00:14:42.330
You're saying you work for that thing?

00:14:42.500 --> 00:14:46.710
Yes. He had something to discuss with you.

00:14:46.710 --> 00:14:50.040
What did he say in that
five second conversation?

00:14:50.040 --> 00:14:51.790
And what if I tell you?

00:14:52.880 --> 00:14:55.250
I have a right to know.

00:14:55.250 --> 00:14:58.920
To know why he ordered me
to keep watching over you.

00:14:58.920 --> 00:15:01.500
Why I had to send you to Quent.

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:04.130
You were acting on its orders?

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:08.130
I've some concept of what he is.

00:15:08.130 --> 00:15:09.960
Just a nebulous one, though.

00:15:10.290 --> 00:15:13.000
Can I assume you do as well, now?

00:15:13.630 --> 00:15:15.670
Where is he?

00:15:15.920 --> 00:15:18.000
Where do I go to really meet him?

00:15:18.250 --> 00:15:19.920
I don't know, either.

00:15:20.250 --> 00:15:24.540
You and I both have only contacted
the intelligence using this method.

00:15:28.210 --> 00:15:30.580
Won't you answer my question?

00:15:30.580 --> 00:15:34.040
Chirico, what did he say to you?

00:15:34.040 --> 00:15:37.580
What connection is there between you and him?

00:15:38.880 --> 00:15:41.880
Why have I been ordered to protect you?

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:46.630
Just because he needs you as a PS
to protect his organization?

00:15:46.960 --> 00:15:48.290
Why won't you answer me?

00:15:48.290 --> 00:15:50.170
Because I don't know, either!

00:15:51.250 --> 00:15:53.080
Who I am...

00:15:53.580 --> 00:15:55.580
or why it called out to me.

00:15:57.250 --> 00:15:58.330
Well, then...

00:16:06.630 --> 00:16:08.130
We'll continue this later.

00:16:08.130 --> 00:16:10.170
We have to get back to the ship. Proto One!

00:16:11.630 --> 00:16:14.920
He just told me a Gilgamesh fleet is approaching.

00:16:14.920 --> 00:16:16.920
Fyana's coming with me.

00:16:16.920 --> 00:16:18.630
You can't just run away.

00:16:18.630 --> 00:16:22.000
Chirico, you're already in his hands.

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:24.130
I'm not giving her back to you.

00:16:24.130 --> 00:16:27.290
And I don't care how your
babbling master feels about it!

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:28.290
Wait! Chirico!

00:16:35.040 --> 00:16:36.290
"Leave them be?"

00:16:48.790 --> 00:16:51.630
What are you going to do now, Chirico?

00:16:51.630 --> 00:16:52.880
I don't know.

00:16:52.880 --> 00:16:57.330
But I'd much rather get back out into the desert
than stay under this thing's protection.

00:16:58.000 --> 00:17:00.460
Shako, can you get us some jijirium?

00:17:00.460 --> 00:17:02.420
Yes, I can get it.

00:17:02.420 --> 00:17:05.790
I owe you a lot, Shako.

00:17:10.880 --> 00:17:12.380
It's them! Run for it!

00:17:21.290 --> 00:17:22.130
This way!

00:17:34.710 --> 00:17:35.790
What the hell?

00:17:36.380 --> 00:17:38.380
What's happening? What's going on here?

00:17:40.380 --> 00:17:41.790
Up! Go up!

00:18:25.380 --> 00:18:27.830
Chirico, it's dangerous to get so far out in front.

00:18:46.540 --> 00:18:47.580
Where are we?

00:18:47.580 --> 00:18:49.290
On top of the tower.

00:18:49.290 --> 00:18:51.040
How do we get down?

00:18:51.330 --> 00:18:52.750
I don't know.

00:18:52.920 --> 00:18:55.540
No Quentian has ever climbed up here.

00:18:55.750 --> 00:18:59.250
Let's head for the edge.
There might be a way down.

00:19:16.500 --> 00:19:19.250
Hold it! If we use our guns,
we could get sent someplace else!

00:19:19.250 --> 00:19:20.250
Hide!

00:19:29.830 --> 00:19:30.750
You okay?

00:19:30.750 --> 00:19:32.500
Yeah! Pull me out!

00:20:00.710 --> 00:20:01.630
Jump!

00:20:34.920 --> 00:20:39.000
Fleet has increased engine output to
50 percent and has gone to DefCon 2.

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:40.580
Go to full output!

00:20:40.580 --> 00:20:43.290
We have to support our
troops' operations in Gomor.

00:20:43.290 --> 00:20:44.080
Sir!

00:20:44.540 --> 00:20:47.000
Engines, ahead full! Maintain present course!

00:20:47.000 --> 00:20:51.830
If we get the Prototype, that Balarant
traitor will lose the upper hand.

00:20:52.170 --> 00:20:54.580
We have to make sure
they take our threats seriously!

00:21:41.960 --> 00:21:43.580
Lock this to your belts.

00:22:14.330 --> 00:22:18.920
Colonel! A Gilgamesh fleet has
appeared in orbit over Quent.

00:22:19.170 --> 00:22:20.460
So, they've come.

00:22:20.750 --> 00:22:23.960
Pass this along to all our troops:
Directive 3, E-2, 5-4.

00:22:23.960 --> 00:22:24.630
Sir!

00:22:28.330 --> 00:22:30.830
I thought you'd be back, Chirico.

00:22:31.630 --> 00:22:33.500
My master has a message for you.

00:22:34.080 --> 00:22:36.130
You're to return with us.

00:22:36.130 --> 00:22:38.920
And you cannot escape him.

00:22:42.040 --> 00:22:46.750
At that moment, the mysterious intelligence's
message reawakened in my mind.

00:22:47.540 --> 00:22:52.210
And I gradually began to understand its meaning.

00:22:54.290 --> 00:22:55.710
Next Episode

00:22:56.130 --> 00:22:59.460
The enormous, dark gravity
which radiates from Quent

00:22:59.460 --> 00:23:02.960
recalls the fiery smell of
the embers of the Astragius Galaxy.

00:23:04.040 --> 00:23:06.330
Plots and plans become ever more complicated.

00:23:06.330 --> 00:23:09.380
Unseen fuses begin to burn.

00:23:10.170 --> 00:23:14.920
Sickening and yet somehow comforting as well,
the smells and sounds of war begin to revive.

00:23:15.710 --> 00:23:17.830
Next time, "Premonition"

00:23:18.380 --> 00:23:20.540
The land beneath Quent shudders and quakes.

00:23:19.630 --> 00:23:24.290
Premonition

00:23:19.630 --> 00:23:24.290
Next Time

00:23:42.540 --> 00:23:46.000
Whenever I'm feeling lonely

00:23:46.000 --> 00:23:49.540
Whenever I'm feeling sad

00:23:49.540 --> 00:23:55.920
I can always see you floating in my mind

00:23:56.420 --> 00:23:59.830
Whenever I'm alone

00:23:59.830 --> 00:24:03.380
Whenever I long for you

00:24:03.380 --> 00:24:09.630
I can always feel you inside my heart

00:24:09.630 --> 00:24:13.130
No matter how far apart we may go

00:24:13.130 --> 00:24:16.540
No matter if my path should part from yours

00:24:16.710 --> 00:24:23.040
The memories of you seem to shine inside my heart...

00:24:23.420 --> 00:24:29.380
Brighter than any other light...
